message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Split-Aware Evaluation of Molecular Featurizers for ADMET Prediction"
abstract: >-
  A per-endpoint evaluation harness comparing molecular featurizers across
  random and scaffold splits with bootstrap confidence intervals, testing
  whether reported ranking differences survive the uncertainty they are
  quoted with.
type: software
